  "humanSetupInstructions": [
    "1. Create an empty GameObject named 'GameManager', attach GameManager.cs and UIManager.cs (assign inspector fields).",
    "2. Create an empty GameObject named 'Pusher', add a Rigidbody component (Kinematic), and attach PusherMovement.cs.",
    "3. For every ScoreZone/SideLossZone, ensure the collider is set to 'Is Trigger' and attach their respective scripts.",
    "4. Ensure Main Camera has an AudioListener, though CameraShake.cs will auto-attach itself to the Main Camera at runtime."
